            <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--primary-color);">Variable Breakdown</h2>

            <div style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                <strong style="color: var(--accent-color);">F (Net Force)</strong>
                <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.95rem;">The vector sum of all forces acting on an object. Measured in Newtons (N).</p>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                <strong style="color: var(--accent-color);">m (Mass)</strong>
                <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.95rem;">The quantity of matter in an object. A measure of its resistance to acceleration. Measured in kilograms (kg).</p>
            </div>

            <div>
                <strong style="color: var(--accent-color);">a (Acceleration)</strong>
                <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.95rem;">The rate of change of velocity of an object with respect to time. Measured in meters per second squared (m/s²).</p>
            </div>
